                <div style="font:500 10px/1 'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6)">Step 02</div>
                <h2 style="margin:12px 0 0;font-family:'Figtree','Instrument Sans',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(28px,3.4vw,46px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-0.028em">Review requirements</h2>
